{"title":"25","section":"604","heading":"Omitted","lead":"","tree":[],"notes":[{"topic":"editorialNotes","text":"Editorial Notes"},{"topic":"codification","text":"Codification Section, act Aug. 9, 1946, ch. 933, § 4, 60 Stat. 969, which related to loss of membership and removal from roll, was omitted from the Code as being of special and not general application."}],"sourceCredit":"","releasePoint":"119-102","ancestors":[{"type":"title","num":"Title 25—","heading":"INDIANS","identifier":"/us/usc/t25"},{"type":"chapter","num":"CHAPTER 14—","heading":"MISCELLANEOUS","identifier":"/us/usc/t25/ch14"},{"type":"subchapter","num":"SUBCHAPTER XVII—","heading":"YAKIMA TRIBES","identifier":"/us/usc/t25/ch14/schXVII"}]}